    "description": "\"Discover this charming Edwardian 3-unit building in the heart of Inner Richmond! Featuring hardwood floors, high ceilings, and those classic architectural details, plus fireplaces in each unit. Recently updated within the last two years, the property includes a spacious 3-bed/1-bath unit and two 1-bed/1-bath units, all occupied with solid rent income. You'll also find a 2 car tandem garage, common laundry area, storage room, and a bonus room with the possibility of being developed into a living space (interested party to independently research ). Enjoy a large backyard and the convenience of being near Golden Gate Park for biking, picnics, and leisurely walks. Plus, USF, the Steinhart Aquarium, and the De Young Museum are just a stone's throw away.\""
